# Gifts

== gift ==
Thanks.
Oh, for me? Thank you.       {polite}
Huh. Thanks, I guess.        {!polite}
Fine. I'll take it.          {rude}
You shouldn't have. Really.  {humble}
About time someone noticed me. {proud}
[item.cap]! Thank you!       {extrovert}
Is this a trick?             {paranoid}
What do you want for [item.it]? {greedy}
Oh, I'll pass [item.it] on to someone who needs [item.it] more. {generous}
Thank you, [listener]. Truly. {opinion=friend, polite}
Aw, [listener]. You're the best. {opinion=close_friend}
Hm. Trying to buy my good opinion? {opinion=disliked}

# How much they like it, whatever it is
[item.cap]! I love [item.it]! {taste=love, w=4}
For me? [item.cap]? Oh, [listener]... {taste=love, w=3}
You remembered! Well. You must have. {taste=love, w=2}
Now this is a gift.          {taste=love, w=2}
Oh, you've made my day.      {taste=love, polite, w=3}
Ha! Brilliant!               {taste=love, lighthearted, w=3}
Ooh, [item.a]. Thanks!       {taste=like, w=3}
Oh, nice. [item.cap].        {taste=like, w=3}
I can use [item.it]. Thanks. {taste=like, hardworking, w=3}
Oh. [item.cap]. Thanks.      {taste=meh, w=3}
Hm. [item.cap]. All right.   {taste=meh, w=3}
I'll find a use for [item.it]. Probably. {taste=meh, w=2}
Ugh, [item]. ...Thanks.      {taste=dislike, polite, w=3}
I don't really like [item], but thanks. {taste=dislike, w=3}
What am I supposed to do with [item.this]? {taste=dislike, w=3}
[item.cap]? Seriously?       {taste=hate, w=3}
Oh. [item.cap]. How... thoughtful. {taste=hate, polite, w=3}
Keep [item.it]. Actually no, you already gave [item.it] to me. Great. {taste=hate, lighthearted, w=3}
I hate [item]. You couldn't have known. ...Could you? {taste=hate, paranoid, w=4}

# Rude gifts: dirt, cobblestone, slime
[item.cap]? You're giving me [item]? {rude_gift=yes, w=6}
Is this a joke? Am I a joke to you? {rude_gift=yes, w=6}
[item.cap]. Wow. Thanks for nothing. {rude_gift=yes, rude, w=8}
I know when I'm being insulted, [listener]. {rude_gift=yes, proud, w=8}
Oh. [item.cap]. That's... that's fine. It's fine. {rude_gift=yes, polite, w=8}
Oh. [item.cap]. That's... that's fine. It's fine. {rude_gift=yes, timid, w=8}
I'll remember this.          {rude_gift=yes, vengeful, w=8}
Ha, very funny. Hand it here, I'll throw it at you later. {rude_gift=yes, lighthearted, w=8}
The Cube God made [item], so I won't complain. Much. {rude_gift=yes, pious, w=8}
Did you dig this up out of my own yard? {rude_gift=yes, kind=junk, w=6}
It's slimy. Why is it slimy? {rude_gift=yes, kind=gross, w=6}
Ugh! Get it away from me!    {rude_gift=yes, kind=gross, proper, w=8}

# Oddballs: they feel very differently about this than most would
[item.cap]! Finally, someone who gets me. {surprising=yes, taste=love, w=8}
People think I'm odd for liking [item], but I don't care. {surprising=yes, taste=love, w=8}
Ooh, [item]! Don't tell anyone I said that. {surprising=yes, taste=like, w=6}
I know everyone loves [item]. I don't. Sorry. {surprising=yes, taste=dislike, w=8}
[item.cap]? Everyone loves [item]. I'm not everyone. {surprising=yes, taste=hate, w=8}
Honestly? [item.cap] doesn't do much for me. {surprising=yes, taste=meh, w=6}
[item.cap]! Oh, I've always wanted some! {surprising=yes, taste=love, kind=junk, w=10}
You know, most people would be insulted. I think it's nice. {surprising=yes, kind=junk, w=8}

# Food
[item.cap]! I love [item.it]! {kind=food, taste=love, w=4}
My favorite! How did you know? {kind=food, taste=love, w=3}
[item.cap]! You're a saint, [listener]. {kind=food, taste=love, glutton, w=4}
I was just thinking about [item]! {kind=food, taste=love, glutton, w=3}
Mm, [item]. Nice.            {kind=food, taste=like, w=2}
[item.cap]. Food is food.    {kind=food, taste=meh, w=2}
I can't stand [item]. Keep [item.it]. {kind=food, taste=hate, rude, w=3}

# Valuables
Is this... real? It's real! {kind=valuable, taste=love, w=4}
[item.cap]! Oh, I'm keeping [item.it] somewhere safe. {kind=valuable, taste=love, w=4}
Mine. All mine. Thank you. {kind=valuable, greedy, w=6}
This is worth a fortune, you know. Are you sure? {kind=valuable, honest, w=5}
This is too much. I can't. ...I will, but I can't. {kind=valuable, humble, w=6}
Shiny. I'll admit, it's shiny. {kind=valuable, taste=meh, w=4}
I'll give [item.it] to someone who cares about that sort of thing. {kind=valuable, generous, w=5}
At last, something worthy of me. {kind=valuable, proud, w=6}

# Materials, tools, weapons, armor
Good, sturdy stuff. I'll put [item.it] to use. {kind=material, hardworking, w=4}
Materials. That means work. Wonderful. {kind=material, lazy, w=4}
[item.cap]. Practical. I like practical. {kind=material, taste=like, w=3}
A proper tool! Now we're talking. {kind=tool, hardworking, w=5}
A tool. Are you trying to tell me something? {kind=tool, lazy, w=5}
I'll get some real work done with [item.this]. {kind=tool, taste=like, w=3}
Ha! Let them come now.        {kind=weapon, brave, w=5}
A weapon? I'd rather not need one. {kind=weapon, timid, w=5}
I know exactly who I'll use this on. {kind=weapon, vengeful, w=5}
Keep your blade, I'd rather talk things out. {kind=weapon, forgiving, taste=dislike, w=5}
Armor! I feel safer already. {kind=armor, timid, w=5}
How do I look? Don't answer that. {kind=armor, lighthearted, w=4}
This'll keep me in one piece. Thanks. {kind=armor, taste=like, w=3}
Now they'll never get me.     {kind=armor, paranoid, w=6}

# Flowers and plants
Flowers? For me? Oh, [listener]... {kind=flower, romantic, w=6}
Flowers. I'm going to press one and keep it forever. {kind=flower, sentimental, w=6}
Ooh, pretty!                  {kind=flower, taste=like, w=3}
What am I, a garden?          {kind=flower, taste=dislike, w=4}
A flower. Huh. Thanks, I suppose. {kind=flower, crude, w=4}
I'll plant [item.it] somewhere nice. {kind=plant, taste=like, w=4}
I'll plant [item.it]. Eventually. {kind=plant, lazy, w=4}

# Curios, music, decor and the rest
Ooh! What does [item.it] do? Never mind, I'll find out. {kind=curio, curious, w=6}
How fascinating.              {kind=curio, taste=like, w=3}
Huh. Clever little thing.     {kind=curio, w=2}
Music! Oh, I love music.      {kind=music, taste=love, w=4}
Ha! We're having a party now. {kind=music, extrovert, w=5}
I don't really dance. Or listen. Thanks, though. {kind=music, taste=dislike, w=4}
This'll look lovely in my home. {kind=decor, taste=like, w=4}
How elegant.                  {kind=decor, proper, w=5}
Where am I supposed to put [item.this]? {kind=decor, taste=dislike, w=4}
Is that going to explode?     {kind=dangerous, w=3}
