Oh, this'll be fun.           {kind=dangerous, brave, w=4}
Oh, this is going to end badly. For someone. {kind=dangerous, hothead, w=6}
Somewhere to rest! Bless you. {kind=comfort, lazy, w=6}
A bed? I don't have time to sleep. {kind=comfort, hardworking, w=5}
Ha! I love [item]!            {kind=fun, lighthearted, w=5}
What is this, a toy?          {kind=fun, serious, w=5}

== gift_full ==
My hands are full.
I've got no room for that.
Can't carry any more, sorry. {polite}
